 8/P4060009-scaled.jpg
UID:7mLzDxbVEExrQXY_mjU5P
SUMMARY:Sound Bath with Daemein Smith (Prioritizing Peace)
DTSTAMP:20260806T111137Z
DTSTART:20260905T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a peaceful morning experience in Hermann Park with 
	a free guided Sound Bath led by Daemein Smith of Prioritizing Peace. Set a
	gainst the natural beauty of the Tsuru Family Terrace in the Commons\, thi
	s immersive meditation experience uses sound and vibration to promote rela
	xation\, mindfulness\, and emotional well-being. Guests are encouraged to 
	slow down\, reset\, and “Prioritize Peace” through a calming journey of so
	und healing in nature. \n Tsuru Family Terrace\n Saturday\, September 5\n 
	8 – 9 a.m.\n Free Community Session \nGuests are encouraged to bring a yog
	a mat if available. Blankets and pillows are also recommended for addition
	al comfort. All ages and experience levels welcome. \nParking: Free parkin
	g available across the street from the Commons in Lot S (6215 Main St\, Ho
	uston\, TX 77030). Additional street parking available along Main Street.\
	n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-11/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-11/
LOCATION:The Commons
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonarboretum.o
 rg/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Beginner-Birding-16x9-Adobe-Stock.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2
 024/07/Beginner-Birding-16x9-Adobe-Stock.jpg
UID:JCxTSfLN8FN4r1XUgHoLQ
SUMMARY:Beginner Birding
DTSTAMP:20260806T111137Z
DTSTART:20260905T093000Z
DESCRIPTION:$22 member / $37 nonmember (per person)Ages 12+\, all minors mu
	st be accompanied by an adult \n\n\n\nIf you have always wanted to get int
	o bird watching but you have never picked up a pair of binoculars\, this c
	lass is for you! Join us for an introduction to birding\, including how to
	 choose binoculars and where to find them\, how to read a field guide\, an
	d where to find birds in Houston. Weather permitting\, we’ll also go out o
	n the trails to practice real birding basics.  \n\n\n\nPlease dress for th
	e weather and wear walking shoes. \n\n\n\n\nregister online\n\nhttps://hou
	stonarboretum.org/event/beginner-birding/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Natu
	re Center
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/beginner-birding/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-arboretum
CATEGORIES:Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
