DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Tsuru Family Terrace (wooden deck by the lawn) i
	n the Commons for Zumba with Tiny Fitness. \n📍 Tsuru Family Terrace\n Satu
	rday\, October 10\n⏰ 9:30 – 10:30 a.m.\n🎟️ Free Community Session \nParking
	:\nFree parking available across the street from the Commons in Lot S (621
	5 Main St\, Houston\, TX 77030). Additional street parking available along
